stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    state "Inbox entry" as Inbox {
        [*] --> processing : first event delivery
        processing --> committed : transaction commits with execution ID
    }

    state "Execution" as Execution {
        [*] --> pending
        pending --> completed : decision persisted
        pending --> failed : terminal processing error
        pending --> quarantined : permanent error
    }

    state "Outbox effect" as Outbox {
        [*] --> pending
        pending --> claimed : publisher claims it with SKIP LOCKED
        claimed --> delivered : destination succeeds
        claimed --> pending : retry after backoff
        claimed --> quarantined : max attempts reached
    }

    state "Shard lease" as Lease {
        [*] --> free
        free --> owned : acquire with owner and ttl
        owned --> free : release or expiry
        owned --> owned : renew with fencing token
    }

    note right of Inbox
        A unique tenant_id + event_id
        permits one committed execution.
    end note

    note right of Execution
        Complete, Fail and Quarantine
        only accept pending as the
        source state.
    end note

    note right of Outbox
        A claim expires so another
        publisher can recover
        abandoned work.
    end note

    note right of Lease
        Expired leases hand the shard
        to a new owner and increment
        the fencing token.
    end note
